{
  "schema_version": "exam-coverage-rules/v1",
  "description": "Data table for the exams_cover_* coverage predicates. Each rule is matched by substring against the completed examination names. `mode` selects how markers combine: any (default), any_excluding (any marker but none of `excluding`), all_groups (every group must match at least one marker), any_group_pair (any group matches).",
